  <item>
    <title>Ep 8：借钱给别人居然自己变开心了！？谁家好人这样啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667e1a65c37399840ca1c842</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667e1a65c37399840ca1c842</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 02:05:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期小王子和焕焕聊了聊上海的梅雨季以及让我们各自开心的五件事。原来快乐并不难，只要我们有一双发现快乐的眼睛就好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a>：上海下了两周的雨，比人先崩溃的是焕焕的窗户不堪重负漏雨了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a>：一些更好地度过梅雨季节的小TIPS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a>：下雨天牛会躲在窝里，马会往棚里跑，牛马会想尽办法出门上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a>： 小王子分享的第一件开心事：打扫卫生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a>： &nbsp;焕焕分享的第一件开心事：开始跑步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a>：小王子分享的第二件开心事：和好朋友聊天&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a>： 焕焕分享的第二件开心事：偷学使人快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a>： 小王子分享的第三件开心事：去旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> ：焕焕分享的第三件开心事：被朋友惦记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a>： 小王子分享的第四件开心事：看电影逛展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a>： 焕焕分享的第四件开心事：被发小借钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a>：焕焕分享的第五件开心事：有期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a>： 小王子分享的第五件开心事：自己动手做饭</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎留言分享最近令你开心的事情哦，毕竟分享可以让快乐加倍~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqtlGgr4e-1eSvdcQaOtC3Nk2I5E.m4a" length="42716729" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFUrlcWbtZKd4VMVQxiMqYzIDXY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep 7: 六月份的尾巴，很适合聊聊迷茫的毕业季</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6674f0dbc26e396a364e6d9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6674f0dbc26e396a364e6d9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 03:17:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业季里，总是鲜花与掌声飞扬。这次趁着6月份，焕焕和小王子讨论了一下当初各自毕业时遇到难以抉择的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a>：没有拍上毕业照，真的是一生的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a>：毫无规划的毕业季，居然也这么过来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a>：小王子的毕业选择之路：继续读博，考公，实习找工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a>：干一行恨一行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a>：身边的同学近况如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a>：事业的尽头是考公考编</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a>：考公走得是一条NPC道路嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a>：专员论打败一切工作上得牛鬼蛇神!</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liYO5496SKliK7UuCnLk7Tm1x5CF.m4a" length="41339369" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFUrlcWbtZKd4VMVQxiMqYzIDXY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
